{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","data":{"body":"Acceptance criteria rewritten 2026-11-01 on operator direction (option (20) chosen): the original ACs required an induced crash on the box, which is not permitted. The replacements prove locally that the server accepts MCP requests before the boot sweep finishes and that shutdown waits for it, and measure container start to server start on the first autodeploy after merge (read-only). Design: boot ensure sweep moves to a background thread holding the 1c51c9dcd06 drain gauge; lock arguments unchanged."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1793525802001606001,"uuid":"1015d376-728b-4bf4-a241-99fe6dea68f6"}